@startuml
actor User
participant FE
participant BE
participant DB

User -> FE : Enter email + password

FE -> BE : POST /register\n(email, password)

BE -> BE : Hash password → bcrypt(password, cost=12)
BE -> BE : Generate RSA-2048 key pair\n(public_key, private_key)
BE -> BE : Derive encryption key\nfrom password (PBKDF2 + salt)
BE -> BE : Encrypt private key using\nderived key (AES-256)
BE -> BE : Discard raw private key from memory

BE -> DB : Store (\n  email,\n  bcrypt_hash,\n  public_key_pem [plain],\n  encrypted_private_key_blob\n)
DB --> BE : OK

BE --> FE : 201 Created
FE --> User : Account created — you can now log in
@enduml